    "media:imagetext": "Panagra\nIN AIR TRANSPORTATION IN\nSOUTH AMERICA\nSchedule effective January 20, 1950 - Good until superseded.\nFly via El Inter Americano\nthe Fastest Shortest Route\nto South America*\nCANADA\nTO ALASKA\nSEATTLE\nMINNEAPOLIS •\nCHICAGO *\nY MONTREAL\nDETROIT\nI BOSTON!\nTO ALL\nEUROPE\nNEW YORK\nWASHINGTON\nSAN FRANCISCO\nDALLAS\n• ST. LOUIS\nTO HAWAII\nTHE ORIENT\nLOS ANGELES\nROUTES OF PANAGRA\nAND PAA-PANAGRA\nGEEN TAKA MAKKAN\nHOUSTON•\nNEW ORLEANS\nCONNECTING CARRIERS\nMEXICO\nHAVANA\nTO ALL\nCENTRAL AMERICA\nEQUATOR\nMIAMI\nSUETO RICO\nESMERALDAS •\nMANTA\nGUAYAQUI\nTALARA\nCHICLAYO\nBALBOA/PANAMA\n• BOGOTA\n• CALI\nO QUITO\nTe CUENCA\nLIMA *\nANTOFAGASTA\nAREQUIPA\n• LA PAZ\nCOCHABAMBA\nCONCEPCION\n• SAN IGNACIO\nROBORI\nROBORE\nSUAREZ\n\" GRANDE\nORURO\nCAMPO\nSANTA CRUZ\nSAO PAULO\n• SALTA\nTUCUMAN\nCORDOBA\nRIO DE JANEIRO\nSANTIAGO *\nMONTEVIDEO\nOS AIRES\n* OVER THE ROUTES OF PAN AMERICAN AND PANAGRA\nPAN AMERICAN-GRACE AIRWAYS INC.",
